G50 S800
G97 S650 M3
G0 X#1 Z.0
G96 S350
G1 X-.040 F.004 M8
G0 X#2 Z.03
G1 Z0 F.003

G1 Z#5 F.007
G0 X20 Z20
M1

NAT03  (CENTER DRILL)
T030303
G0 X20 Z20
G97 S650 M3
G0 X.0 Z.05
G1 Z-.15 F.0015
G0 Z.1
G0 X20 Z20
M1

NAT06   (DRILL .590)
T060606
G0 X20 Z20
G97 S400 M3
G0 X.0 Z.05
G1 Z-.4 F.002 
G0 Z.1
G0 X20 Z20
